To build for desktop emulation, use the buildit_for_host.sh script.

To build for device, you can use packageit.sh with the option "pre",
"pixi", or "emulator".  For the "simple" example, The emulator build
will not complete because we don't ship OpenGL ES libraries for the HP
webOS emulator, but it's there to show an example of how to use the
i686-linux tools.

The "pre" target will run on all webOS devices but the original Palm
Pixi.  The Pixi shipped with an older ARMv6 core, while the Palm Pre
and all newer devices ship with at least an ARMv7 core with NEON
instructions.  Code built for the Pixi will run on the Pre, but
without as many optimizations.

